Package: gmaio
Title: Downstream Analysis of genome_metagenome_all_in_one Pipeline Output
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Julian", "Zaugg", , "j.zaugg@uq.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads, links and analyses the output of the genome_metagenome_all_in_one
    Nextflow pipeline for metagenomes and isolate genomes. Provides readers for each
    pipeline output, a common feature-profile data model, consistent palettes, tables,
    figures and statistics, and project templates with a main entry point script and
    one script per analysis.
